# ============================================================
# Mercado Pago Subscription — Environment Variables
# Copy these to your .env.local (frontend) and Supabase secrets (Edge Functions)
# Guía: MERCADOPAGO_SETUP.md · Arquitectura: docs/beta-mp/README.md
# ============================================================

# ─── Frontend (.env.local) ───────────────────────────────────
# El frontend NO necesita ids de plan ni credenciales de Mercado Pago.
# Las variables VITE_MP_PLAN_* de versiones anteriores ya no se leen.
#
# Already present:
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxx.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJxxxx

# ─── Supabase Edge Function Secrets ──────────────────────────
# Run: supabase secrets set KEY=VALUE
#
# MP_ACCESS_TOKEN=APP_USR-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX-XXXXXX-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX-XXXXXXXXX
# MP_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your-webhook-secret-from-mp-dashboard
# APP_URL=https://www.techrepairpro.app
# MP_CORS_ORIGIN=                                (optional: extra origins, comma-separated)
# SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxx.supabase.co         (auto-injected)
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJxxxx                      (auto-injected)
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJxxxx              (auto-injected)
#
# Plan B (2026-10-02): el servidor crea cada suscripción por API con el precio de
# su catálogo (supabase/functions/_shared/billing/planCatalog.ts). No hay planes
# que crear en el panel y los secrets MP_PLAN_* ya no se leen.
#
# ─── Webhook URL to configure in MP dashboard (modo productivo) ─
# https://xxxx.supabase.co/functions/v1/mp-webhook
#
# Events to subscribe: subscription_preapproval, subscription_authorized_payment
# (payment is optional: it is logged and writes nothing)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
